{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Oh, tis the first tis flattery in my seeing, and my great mind most kingly drinks it up. Mine eye well knows what with his gust is greeing, and to his palate doth prepare the cup. If it be poisoned, tis the lesser sin, that mine eye loves it, and doth first begin.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Oh", ",", " t", "is", " the", " first", " t", "is", " fl", "attery", " in", " my", " seeing", ",", " and", " my", " great", " mind", " most", " k", "ingly", " drinks", " it", " up", ".", " Mine", " eye", " well", " knows", " what", " with", " his", " gust", " is", " g", "ree", "ing", ",", " and", " to", " his", " palate", " do", "th", " prepare", " the", " cup", ".", " If", " it", " be", " poisoned", ",", " t", "is", " the", " lesser", " sin", ",", " that", " mine", " eye", " loves", " it", ",", " and", " do", "th", " first", " begin", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
